          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Goliati Mala-mala wa Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu shikū jenījo a Bafilisiti būbilinga mabità gabo Soko mu sī ya Yuda, kūlwa nguno ya būlūgū; būtūūla ng'hambī yabo Efesi-damimu ha gatī ya Soko na Azeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo na a Baisilaeli nabo bibilinga, ī ng'hambī yabo būtūūla mu ntubīlo gwa sī ya Ela, bihela kwenūko kūlwa kwilwisha būlūgū na a Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafilisiti būbiza kū lwandī lūmò, a Baisilaeli nabo ū kū lwandī ū lūngī; a ha gatī yūbiza ho sī ya ntubīlo ya kūbalekanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti lyaalīko ling'wana litanagwa lī Goliati lya Gaasi, kwimanīla lyaafumīla ha ng'waape, lyaalī idaaji lya būlīhu wa kūkīla fuuti kenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū ntwe lyaalī līzwalile ihima lya chūma sha shaba, hūna lyūzwala igoodi lya magambala ga chūma sha shaba, lya būdito wa kilo makūmi atanò na mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū magūlū lyalī līzwalile maachūma ga shaba ga kūlang'hana milūndī; hama lyalī n'ichimu ū kū ngongo lītunganījiwe ū kū shizwalo shalyo sha būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nang'ha gw'ichimu lyalyo lyal'ibbūmbūsī itaale no, hangī igīnu gītī ng'wīīsī; ī chūma sh'ichimu shalī na būdito wa kilo mpungatī. Ū lūmūda lwalyo lyabūūkījiagwa na munhū watongela ū kū būtongi walyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī lī Goliati lyenīlo lyīmīīla, lyandya kūgahamukīla a mabità ga Baisilaeli līlīhaya, “Ng'wizaga kwamba būlūgū kūkooba kī? Ū nene natī Mfilisiti, a bing'we ning'we mutī batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo? Solagi munhū wize aha nalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū alaadūle ū kūlwa na nene anibūlage, tūkūbiza banhū bing'we mutūsuge; alīyo ūlū nūng'heeba ū nene nūmūlaga, a bing'we mukūbiza banhū bise, tūkūmusuga muyūūtūtūmamīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lī Goliati lyongeja kūhaya, “Ī lelo leki nagasondagūle a mabità ga Baisilaeli! Ninhagi munhū nalwe nang'hwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo na a Baisilaeli aho bīyiigwa ī mihayo yi Ifilisiti lyenīlo būzwangana no, hama bogoha na kogohele kangī nako nīyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūja kū būlūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū Daūdi walī ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese wa Betelehemu ya Yuda, munhū wa lūganda lwa Baefulaimu. Ū Yese ng'wenūyo walī na bitūnja banaane, ū mu shikū ja ntemi Saulo walī namhala wa shikū ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yese a badatū a bataale baalī baja nū Saulo ū kū būlūgū; ū wa kwandya walī Eliabu, wa kabīlī Abinadabu, ū wa kadatū Shama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi walī kwangūlīja wabo, na lūūlū a badatū a batongi kūbyalwa hū baalī baja nū Saulo ū kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wajaga ū kūlī Saulo, alīyo wītaga washoka hangī kaya Betelehemu, kūdīīma ng'holo ja ng'wawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'holo ja ng'wawe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ng'holo ja ng'wa ise.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Līfilisiti ī lidaaji līkashisha shikū makūmi anè līkūmanagūūfumīla ha ng'waape ī dilū nī mhīndī, lyīmīīla kwikumīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Yese ūng'wīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Daūdi, “Bebe anukūlaga kaaka kadebbe ka tūūshilīwa tūkalangile na tū migatī ikūmi, ūbapeegeje a bakūlūyo ū kū ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūūtū na tūshibanda ikūmi twa mashishanga galaalile ūkang'winhe ū ntaale w'ibità lya ng'hambī yabo. Ūbabone nū mumo balī a bakūlūyo, ūnenhele ī mhola ja mihayo ūmo īlījīīla koi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo na a Baisilaeli a bose baalī ū kū ntubīlo gwa Ela, nguno ya kwilwiisha būlūgū na a Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wela ī dilū ū Daūdi ūbūūka, ī ng'holo ūjileka na ndīīmi ūngī, ū wei ūja gīt'ūmo walī walagīīlīlwa nū Yese. Ūshika ū kwibità, ūsanga a bashilikale balīja ū kū būlwīīlo wa būlūgū, kūnū bakwitongaga n'ilaka lya higūlya mihayo ya kwitimbya ng'holò mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli na a Bafilisiti būhela mabità bikiimaalīlaga, būlī bene kū lwandī lwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikolo īsho akasheenha ū Daūdi ūshileka ha ng'hambī, ūnekela nang'hani ūyo walī watūūlwa kūlang'hana shikolo, ū wei ūpeela ajile ūko baalī baakamba būlūgū; ūshika ūbagīsha a bakūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho ataalī ūyomba nabo a bakūlūye, kwimanīla lyapuluka ī lī Goliati lya Gaasi, ī lī mala mala lya Bafilisiti; lyīnga ū ng'wibità lyūkitenda ha ng'wape, lyandya kūbahamukīla higūlya līkwitagūlaga ū būsondagūji walyo gīt'ūmo lyītīlaga na kale; nū Daūdi ūwigwa ū būsondagūji wenūbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho baalībona, pyī būpeela bogohaga kībi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bandya kwiwīla, “Mulīlībona ī ling'wana lyenīlo? Lyapuluka hangī kūbasondagūla a Baisilaeli. Ūlū munhū ūlībūlaga ī lyenīlo akūsabiwa no nū ntemi; nīyo ū ntemi akūng'winha ū munhū ng'wenūyo nshīke wakwe abize nke wakwe, hama nī kaya ya ng'wawe ītalalipa goodi ū mu Isilaeli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūbabūūja a banhū abo baalī bīmīīla bbihī nang'hwe, “Bing'we ū munhū wa kūlībūlaga ī Līfilisiti lyenīlo, ūbīngīja a Baisilaeli ī libengwe ī litaale lyenīlī, akwītīlwa mhayo kī? Ī gete nīyo ū Mfilisiti ng'wenūyū ni nani, nibūlī wikale akūsondagūlaga gīko mabità ga ng'wa Mulungu mpanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būng'wīla ī mihayo īyo biwīlaga; būhaya, “Ū wa kūlībūlaga ī lyenīlo akwītīlwa ī mihayo yenīyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkūlūye ū ntaale ū Eliabu aho wang'wigwa akūyombaga nabo a banhū benabo ūmpelanīla no; ūmūūja, “Ī gete ū bebe, wenhagwa kī ū kūūnū? Īkī walekaga tūkolo kū matogolo ūko; nani ūyo wanekelaga ī gīsī? Angū nabūmanile ū witūūla tūūji wako nī nyachilū yako; ū bebe wizaga kūlola būlūgū dūhū ū kūūnū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Hama naakenya kī ī gīsī, naleke nūūlū kūlūngalūnga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūngalūkīla munhū ūngī ūmūūja hangī ī mihayo yenīyo; a banhū būnshokeela ū kūng'wīla gīt'ūmo baalī bang'wīlīla dūhū a ha kwandya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kū būtongi bo ng'wa Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyo akīhaya ū Daūdi yigwiwa na banhū, bīshisha kūlī Saulo; ū Saulo ūlagīja itanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho washika a halī Saulo ūng'wīla, “Yaya ū kūfung'wa ng'holò kūlwa nguno ya ng'wing'wana ng'wenūyo dūhū; ū nene ntūmami wako nakūja koi nakalwe nang'hwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūnshokeja ū Daūdi alīhaya, “Ū bebe ūtūdūla ū kwikiimalīla nang'hwe ū Mfilisiti ng'wenūyo gīkī ūlwe nang'hwe būlūgū, nguno ūlī nyanda ndo no; alīyo ū wei munhū wa būlūgū kwīngīīla ha būyanda wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daūdi nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Ū ntūmami wako akabizaga na nīmo gwa kūdīīma ng'holo ja ng'wa ise. Yabīta kwiza shimba na ndūba ū ng'widaale yūūdima ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ntūmami wako nīsanga nūkītūla nīhulumūja ī ng'holo ū mu nomo gwayo. Aho yaanigalūkīla nīdima ū būyenze wayo nītūla, nībūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wako īkī wabīta kūbūlaga shimba na ndūba, nū Mfilisiti ūyo atasaalilwe ng'wenūyū akūbiza ūmò waho; nguno wagasondagūlaga mabità ga ng'wa Mulungu mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūyo wanipīja kūfuma mu makanwa ga shimba na makanwa ga ndūba, hū ng'wene ūyo akūnipīja nū mu makono ga Mfilisiti ng'wenūyū.” Hūna ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū Daūdi; “Jaga SEEBA abize hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Saulo ūnzwalīkīja ū Daūdi ī shizwalo shakwe sha būlūgū; ūngumīīla ī ligoodi lyakwe lya būlūgū, n'ihima lya chūma sha shaba ūntūūlīla ū kū ntwe gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūlūtunga mu nkīmbīlī gwakwe ū lūshū lo Saulo, hūna ūgema kūshimīza shimīza a henaho nguno ī shikolo shenīsho walī atashimanīīlile. Ūng'wīla ū Saulo, “Baba ntemi, natūdūla ū kūja nasho ī shenīshi, nguno natashimanīīlile.” Na lūūlū ūshizuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbūūcha nang'ha gwakwe mu nkono, ūsola na tūwe twibilingu bilingu tūtanò kūfuma mu longa, ūtūtūūla mu mfuko gwakwe gwa nyadīīmi, ūsola na lūtaago lwakwe mu nkono; ūnsanga ū Mfilisiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Goliati na Daūdi kwiponangīja mihayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mfilisiti nang'hwe hamò nū mūūcha wa lūmūda lwakwe wegeela ū kūlī Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wanola chiza ūng'wibengeleja, nguno akabona gīkī gashi nīyo walī nyanda ndo dūhū, wikoba lyaaza na suso nsoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Chii bebe, ūlīnizīīla wa milang'ha ūliganika nalī mvwa ū nene?” Ū Mfilisiti ng'wenūyo wandya kūnzuma ū Daūdi mu lina lya bamulungu bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla alīhaya, “Al'egeelaga ū mimba gwako nakūjinha noni ja hape na shiinu ja mu matogolo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Mfilisiti, “Ū bebe angū ūliza kūnisakamīla bo lūshū n'ichimu na someke; alīyo ū nene nalīkwizīīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Ndūji wa shose; ū Mulungu wa mabità ga Baisilaeli abo ūkūbasondagūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo ū SEEBA akūkūtūūla mu nkono gwane, nakūtūle nagūtīne ū ntwe gwako. Nīyo ī lelo yenīyī ī mibimba ya mabità ga Bafilisiti nakūjinha noni ja hape, na shiinū ja hasī; hūna pyī ī sī īkūdeeba gīkī alīho Mulungu ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo biibilingaga henaha bakūdeeba gīkī ū SEEBA atapījaga bo kūtūmamīla shū nūūlū machimu; nguno ū būlūgū wene bo ng'wa SEEBA, na lūūlū a bing'we bose ūmo mugelelile akūmutūūla mu makono gise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mfilisiti wandya kūng'wegeela ū Daūdi; ū Daūdi nag'hwe ūpeela ajile a ha būtobanīlo, aje akatūūng'wanhe nang'hwe bambe būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtwenga nkono mu fuko ūsola iwe, ūlītūūla mu lūtaago lokwe hūna ūlūhulinja, ūnkaala ū Mfilisiti iwe lya ha būshū; lyūlibīla mu ntwe ī liwe. Ū Mfilisiti witaalīka hasī abundaalile!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Goliati kūbūlagwa, na Bafilisiti kūpeela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūbiza wantinda ū Mfilisiti bo lūtaago n'iwe; nūūlū īkī walī atī na lūshū mu nkono ū Daūdi, alīyo akantūla ū Mfilisiti ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūpeela ajile hoi ū Daūdi, ūūkampanda wīmīīla a higūlya yakwe; ūlīdima ī līlūshū lyakwe ū Mfilisiti ng'wenūyo, ūlīsopoola ū mu shilaalo shalyo ūmalīja, hūna ūgūtīna ū ntwe na līlūshū lyenīlo. A Bafilisti aho babona gīkī ū mala mala wabo wabūlagwa, būgalūka būduta nhambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Isilaeli na Yuda būyoga kayogele kataale ka būtindi, būhūūma bīngile ūko baalī; būboolomya nhambo a Bafilisiti kūshisha Gaasi na kū mibita ya Ekuloni. A Bafilisiti baja bakūbūlagagwa nzīla ngima kūfuma Shalaimu kūjūūshik'ī Gaasi nī Ekuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho baashoka ū kūfuma ū kūbapeeja a Bafilisti, bingīla ū mu ng'hambī yabo būshisola ī shikolo īsho bakashisanga moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.53",
